  "aiContextParagraph": "Former Brazilian president Jair Bolsonaro was admitted to the DF Star Hospital in Brasília on November 20, 2026. Initial reports indicated he was in the intensive care unit due to an acute bowel obstruction, with a subsequent diagnosis of pneumonia. Over the past week, medical bulletins have characterized his condition as stable with discrete clinical improvement. As of late November, the medical team continues to oversee his recovery, which includes ongoing antibiotic therapy and physical therapy sessions. While doctors have allowed him to begin a liquid diet, he remains under observation in the ICU. Public interest has also surfaced regarding the former president's personal matters during his hospital stay, including social media commentary surrounding his dietary preferences. There is currently no confirmed date for his hospital release.",
